<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">STUDIO</view><view class="title">模板剪辑</view>
  <view class="intro">选择素材与模板，调整镜头，生成当前版本的成片。</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{!signedIn}}"><view class="card-title">连接个人空间</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">登录账号</button></view>
  <view class="card" wx:elif="{{!projectSelected}}"><view class="card-title">先选择项目</view><button class="primary" bindtap="chooseProject">返回创作工作台</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{pendingLabel}}"><view class="card-title">核对原提交</view><view class="muted">{{pendingLabel}} 的结果尚未确认。继续原提交会保留原操作标识。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="recover" disabled="{{saving}}">查询提交结果</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="recover" data-repeat="true" disabled="{{saving}}">继续原提交</button></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="card-title">新建剪辑计划</view><view class="row"><text class="muted">已选 {{selectedCount}} 个项目素材</text><button class="small-button" bindtap="chooseAssets">选择素材</button></view>
      <picker range="{{templateNames}}" value="{{templateIndex}}" bindchange="templateChange"><view class="input">{{templateNames[templateIndex] || '暂无模板'}}</view></picker>
      <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{target}}" bindinput="targetInput" placeholder="目标秒数，留空使用模板时长" />
      <picker range="{{aspects}}" value="{{aspectIndex}}" bindchange="aspectChange"><view class="input">{{aspects[aspectIndex]}}</view></picker>
      <button class="primary" bindtap="createPlan" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{loading || saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || !templates.length || !selectedCount}}">按当前素材新建计划</button>
    </view>
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{plans.length}}"><view class="card-title">已有计划</view><picker range="{{planNames}}" value="{{planIndex}}" bindchange="planChange"><view class="input">{{planNames[planIndex]}}</view></picker></view>
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{plan}}"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">计划{{planStatus}}</view><button class="small-button" bindtap="refreshRevision" disabled="{{saving}}">刷新</button></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{planFailure}}">{{planFailure}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{canRetryPlan}}" bindtap="retry" data-kind="plan" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">恢复原计划任务</button></view>
    <block wx:if="{{revision}}">
      <view class="section-title">编辑版本 v{{revision.number}} · {{shots.length}} 个镜头</view>
      <view class="muted">{{timing}}</view>
      <view class="track" wx:for="{{tracks}}" wx:for-item="track" wx:key="id"><view class="label">{{track.name}}</view><scroll-view scroll-x="{{true}}" class="clip-strip"><view class="clip-strip-inner"><button wx:for="{{track.clips}}" wx:for-item="segment" wx:key="id" bindtap="choosePrecise" data-id="{{segment.id}}" class="clip-segment {{preciseId === segment.id ? 'selected' : ''}}"><view>{{segment.label}}</view><view class="small">{{segment.time}}</view></button></view></scroll-view></view>
      <view class="card draft" wx:if="{{draftLabel}}"><view class="card-title">未保存修改</view><view class="muted">{{draftLabel}}</view><view class="small">先刷新载入新版，再决定是否重新应用原修改。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refreshRevision" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">载入当前版本并保留草稿</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="reapplyDraft" disabled="{{!draftRebased || saving || pendingLabel}}">重新应用原修改</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="discardDraft" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">放弃本地草稿</button></view>
      <view class="warning" wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view>
      <view class="warning" wx:if="{{revision.plan.missing_required_slots.length}}">仍缺少必选槽位：{{revision.plan.missing_required_slots}}。请添加已分析素材后重新匹配。</view>
      <view class="card precise" wx:if="{{preciseName &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft}}"><view class="card-title">{{preciseName}}{{preciseLocked ? ' · 已锁定' : ''}}</view><view class="small">{{preciseBounds}}</view><view class="muted">主视频裁切后顺接；其他轨道保持原时间点，超出新时长会拒绝保存。时间按当前帧率向内对齐。</view>
        <text class="label">源起点（秒）</text><input class="input" value="{{sourceStart}}" type="digit" bindinput="preciseInput" data-field="sourceStart" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !preciseKind) || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'trim')}}" />
        <text class="label">源终点（秒）</text><input class="input" value="{{sourceEnd}}" type="digit" bindinput="preciseInput" data-field="sourceEnd" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !preciseKind) || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'trim')}}" />
        <button class="secondary" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="trim" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || preciseType !== 'video' || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'trim')}}">裁切并顺接</button>
        <text class="label">分割偏移（从片段开头算起，秒）</text><input class="input" value="{{splitOffset}}" type="digit" bindinput="preciseInput" data-field="splitOffset" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !preciseKind) || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'split')}}" />
        <button class="secondary" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="split" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || preciseType !== 'video' || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'split')}}">分割片段</button>
        <text class="label">原声音量倍数（0静音，1原音，最多4）</text><input class="input" value="{{clipVolume}}" type="digit" bindinput="preciseInput" data-field="clipVolume" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !preciseKind) || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'volume')}}" />
        <button class="secondary" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="volume" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (preciseType !== 'video' &amp;&amp; preciseType !== 'audio') || (preciseKind &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'volume')}}">保存原声音量</button>
        <view class="label">画面适配</view><picker range="{{fitNames}}" value="{{fitIndex}}" bindchange="preciseInput" data-field="fitIndex" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'fit')}}"><view class="input">{{fitNames[fitIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="secondary" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="fit" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || preciseType !== 'video' || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'fit')}}">保存适配</button>
        <view class="label">本片段入场转场</view><picker range="{{transitionNames}}" value="{{transitionIndex}}" bindchange="preciseInput" data-field="transitionIndex" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'transition')}}"><view class="input">{{transitionNames[transitionIndex]}}</view></picker><input class="input" value="{{transitionDuration}}" bindinput="preciseInput" data-field="transitionDuration" placeholder="转场时长（秒）" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'transition')}}"/><view class="small">与前片段重叠，成片随之缩短；首片段不能加转场。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="transition" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseLocked || preciseType !== 'video' || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; preciseKind !== 'transition')}}">保存转场</button>
        <view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="up" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || preciseLocked || preciseType !== 'video' || preciseIndex === 0}}">片段前移</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="down" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || preciseLocked || preciseType !== 'video' || preciseIndex === preciseCount - 1}}">片段后移</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="preciseAction" data-kind="delete" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || preciseLocked || preciseType !== 'video' || preciseCount &lt; 2}}">删除并顺接</button></view>
      </view>
      <view class="card shot {{item.locked ? 'locked' : ''}}" wx:for="{{shots}}" wx:key="selection_id"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">{{index + 1}}. {{item.slotName}}</view><text class="pill" wx:if="{{item.locked}}">已锁定</text></view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="small">源 {{item.sourceText}} · 成片 {{item.targetText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="lockShot" data-id="{{item.selection_id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">{{item.locked ? '解锁' : '锁定'}}</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="replaceShot" data-id="{{item.selection_id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || item.locked}}">替换</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="replanShot" data-id="{{item.selection_id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || item.locked}}">重算此镜头</button></view></view>
      <view class="card" wx:if="{{candidateSelection}}"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">替换候选</view><button class="small-button" bindtap="closeCandidates">收起</button></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!candidates.length}}">暂无可替换镜头。</view><view class="candidate" wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="candidate_id"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="small">{{item.timeText}}</view><button class="small-button" data-id="{{item.candidate_id}}" bindtap="adoptCandidate" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">采用这个镜头</button></view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{candidates.length &lt; candidateTotal}}" bindtap="moreCandidates">加载更多候选</button></view>
      <view class="card"><view class="card-title">字幕与原文</view><view class="muted">导入只读取已有识别，不重新识别，不覆盖已有修订。随源字幕跟随视频区间调整；固定时间字幕保留成片时间点。</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="importSubtitles" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">导入已有识别</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="newSubtitle" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">手动添加</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="toggleOriginals">查看保存的原文</button></view>
        <view class="subtitle-cue" wx:for="{{subtitleCues}}" wx:key="id"><view class="subtitle-text">{{item.text}}</view><view class="small">{{item.time}} · {{item.anchor}}</view><view class="small subtitle-text" wx:if="{{item.original}}">原文：{{item.original}}</view><view class="warning" wx:if="{{item.partial}}">只采用了原句部分音频，请审阅文字。</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="editSubtitle" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">编辑这句</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="deleteSubtitle" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">删除这句</button></view></view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{subtitleMore}}" bindtap="moreSubtitleCues">加载更多字幕</button>
        <view wx:if="{{subtitleEditing}}"><view class="label">{{subtitleMissing ? '新版已删除原句，保留文字草稿' : '字幕修订'}}</view><textarea class="input subtitle-textarea" value="{{subtitleForm.text}}" maxlength="20000" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="text" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" />
          <text class="label">字幕起点（秒）</text><input class="input" value="{{subtitleForm.start}}" type="digit" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="start" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || subtitleForm.anchorMode === 'keep' || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" /><text class="label">字幕终点（秒）</text><input class="input" value="{{subtitleForm.end}}" type="digit" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="end" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || subtitleForm.anchorMode === 'keep' || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" />
          <text class="label">字幕时间方式</text><picker range="{{subtitleModes}}" value="{{subtitleModeIndex}}" bindchange="subtitleModeChange" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}"><view class="input">{{subtitleModes[subtitleModeIndex]}}</view></picker><picker range="{{subtitleAnchorNames}}" value="{{subtitleAnchorIndex}}" bindchange="subtitleAnchorChange" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || subtitleForm.anchorMode !== 'clip' || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}"><view class="input">{{subtitleAnchorNames[subtitleAnchorIndex] || '无可关联片段'}}</view></picker>
          <text class="label">字号（12–160）</text><input class="input" value="{{subtitleForm.fontSize}}" type="number" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="fontSize" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" /><text class="label">颜色（white、black、red或#RRGGBB）</text><input class="input" value="{{subtitleForm.color}}" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="color" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" /><text class="label">横向位置（像素）</text><input class="input" value="{{subtitleForm.x}}" type="digit" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="x" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" /><text class="label">纵向位置（像素）</text><input class="input" value="{{subtitleForm.y}}" type="digit" bindinput="subtitleInput" data-field="y" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}" />
          <view class="subtitle-preview" style="font-size:{{subtitlePreviewSize}}px;color:{{subtitlePreviewColor}}">{{subtitleForm.text || '字幕样式示意'}}</view><view class="small">样式示意，实际画面以媒体预览为准；导出文本文件仅含文字和时间。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="saveSubtitle" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || subtitleMissing || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasSubtitleDraft)}}">保存这句字幕</button><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{subtitleMissing &amp;&amp; hasSubtitleDraft}}" bindtap="copySubtitleAsNew" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">将保留文字转为新增字幕</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="closeSubtitle" disabled="{{draftLabel}}">收起编辑</button>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{showOriginals}}"><view class="label">当前版本保存的 ASR 原文</view><view class="subtitle-cue" wx:for="{{originals}}" wx:key="key"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="small">源 {{item.time}}</view><view class="subtitle-text">{{item.text}}</view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!originals.length}}">该版本没有保存可用原文。导入已有识别时可读取当前项目的分析，不发起新识别。</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{originalMore}}" bindtap="moreOriginals">加载更多原文</button></view>
        <view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="exportSubtitles" data-format="srt" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || !subtitleCues.length}}">导出 SRT</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="exportSubtitles" data-format="vtt" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || !subtitleCues.length}}">导出 VTT</button></view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{subtitleExportPath}}" bindtap="shareSubtitleFile">选择字幕文件接收位置</button>
      </view>
      <view class="card"><view class="card-title">音轨和画面叠加</view><view class="muted">在素材页选择并加入本版本。叠加画面不带声音，需要声音时另加音轨。同轨不能重叠，多轨可混合。</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="newLayer" data-kind="audio" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">添加音轨</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="newLayer" data-kind="overlay" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">添加叠加</button></view>
        <view class="candidate" wx:for="{{tracks}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="track"><view>{{track.name}} · {{track.id}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="layerTrackAction" data-id="{{track.id}}" data-kind="mute" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">{{track.muteText}}</button><block wx:if="{{track.type !== 'video'}}"><button class="small-button" bindtap="layerTrackAction" data-id="{{track.id}}" data-kind="up" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || track.index &lt;= 1}}">轨道上移</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="layerTrackAction" data-id="{{track.id}}" data-kind="down" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || track.index === tracks.length - 1}}">轨道下移</button></block><button wx:if="{{track.type === 'audio' || track.type === 'overlay'}}" class="small-button" bindtap="layerTrackAction" data-id="{{track.id}}" data-kind="delete" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">删除整轨</button></view><block wx:if="{{track.type === 'audio' || track.type === 'overlay'}}"><view wx:for="{{track.clips}}" wx:key="id"><view class="small">{{item.label}} · {{item.time}}</view><button class="small-button" bindtap="choosePrecise" data-id="{{item.id}}">编辑</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="deleteLayer" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">删除片段</button></view></block></view>
        <view wx:if="{{layerEditing}}"><view class="label">{{layerForm.kind === 'audio' ? '音轨片段' : '画面叠加'}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{layerMissing}}">原片段已删除，草稿仍保留。</view><picker range="{{layerSourceNames}}" value="{{layerSourceIndex}}" bindchange="layerChoice" data-field="assetId" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}"><view class="input">{{layerSourceNames[layerSourceIndex] || '请先加入本版本素材'}}</view></picker>
          <block wx:for="{{layerCommonFields}}" wx:key="key"><view class="label">{{item.label}}</view><input class="input" value="{{layerForm[item.key]}}" bindinput="layerInput" data-field="{{item.key}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}"/></block>
          <block wx:if="{{layerForm.kind === 'audio'}}"><picker range="{{layerRoleNames}}" value="{{layerRoleIndex}}" bindchange="layerChoice" data-field="role" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}"><view class="input">{{layerRoleNames[layerRoleIndex]}}</view></picker><block wx:for="{{layerAudioFields}}" wx:key="key"><view class="label">{{item.label}}</view><input class="input" value="{{layerForm[item.key]}}" bindinput="layerInput" data-field="{{item.key}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}"/></block></block>
          <block wx:else><block wx:for="{{layerOverlayFields}}" wx:key="key"><view class="label">{{item.label}}</view><input class="input" value="{{layerForm[item.key]}}" bindinput="layerInput" data-field="{{item.key}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}"/></block><picker range="{{fitNames}}" value="{{layerFitIndex}}" bindchange="layerChoice" data-field="fit" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}"><view class="input">{{fitNames[layerFitIndex]}}</view></picker></block>
          <button class="secondary" bindtap="saveLayer" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || hasRejectedDraft || layerMissing || !layerSourceIds.length || (draftLabel &amp;&amp; !hasLayerDraft)}}">保存片段</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="copyLayerAsNew" wx:if="{{layerMissing &amp;&amp; hasLayerDraft}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">将保留参数转为新增片段</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="closeLayer" disabled="{{draftLabel}}">收起编辑</button>
        </view></view>
      <view class="card"><view class="card-title">画幅与时长</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{editTarget}}" bindinput="editTargetInput" placeholder="留空使用可用素材时长" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseKind || hasRejectedDraft || hasSubtitleDraft || hasLayerDraft}}" /><picker range="{{aspects}}" value="{{editAspectIndex}}" bindchange="editAspectChange" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseKind || hasRejectedDraft || hasSubtitleDraft || hasLayerDraft}}"><view class="input">{{aspects[editAspectIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="secondary" bindtap="saveConfig" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || preciseKind || hasRejectedDraft || hasSubtitleDraft || hasLayerDraft}}">保存为新版本</button></view>
      <view class="actions"><button class="small-button" bindtap="undo" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || !revision.undo_revision_id}}">撤销上次修改</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="replanAll" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">重算未锁定镜头</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="addSources" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel}}">将所选素材加入本版本</button><button class="small-button" bindtap="history">版本历史</button></view>
      <view class="card" wx:if="{{showHistory}}"><view class="card-title">版本历史</view><view class="candidate" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="revision_id"><view>v{{item.number}} · {{item.created_at}}</view><button class="small-button" bindtap="restoreVersion" data-id="{{item.revision_id}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || draftLabel || item.revision_id === revision.revision_id}}">从此版本恢复</button></view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{historyMore}}" bindtap="moreHistory">加载更早版本</button></view>
      <view class="card"><view class="card-title">生成成片</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{renderSupport}}">{{renderSupport}}</view><view class="muted">仅渲染当前 v{{revision.number}}。同版本与规格先查询原任务，另建生成须重新确认报价；作品须通过质检并完成归档后才能领取。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="render" data-quality="draft" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || !revision}}">生成或查看当前预览</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="render" data-quality="high" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel || !revision}}">生成或审阅当前高清成片</button><view class="status">{{renderStatus}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{renderFailure}}">{{renderFailure}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{canRetryRender}}" bindtap="retry" data-kind="render" disabled="{{saving || pendingLabel}}">恢复原渲染任务</button><view wx:if="{{renderJob}}"><view class="small">另建任务会产生新的费用操作；先获取报价后决定，旧任务与成片保留。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="render" data-quality="draft" data-fresh="true" disabled="{{!canRender || renderJob.status === 'queued' || renderJob.status === 'running'}}">预览版重新报价</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="render" data-quality="high" data-fresh="true" disabled="{{!canRender || renderJob.status === 'queued' || renderJob.status === 'running'}}">高清版重新报价</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="openWorks">到作品页查看与领取</button></view>
    </block>
  </block>
  <view class="status" role="status">{{status}}</view>
</view>
